<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/4 (FIM 257.94).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/4 (FIM 257.94).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR fell $2 to $56-1/4 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 257.94 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday Nokia A closed down 2.60 markka at 262.40.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) rose to 32-3/4 on Wall Street on Tuesday. The price equals about 75.09 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed flat at 75.80.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Tuesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 0.50 markka lower at 86.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
